<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 80-day NCDs yield at 4.733 percent.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 80-day NCDs yield at 4.733 percent.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$10 billion in 80-day negotiable certificates of deposits on Tuesday at an average yield of 4.733 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the yields was between 4.500 and 4.920 percent. Demand totalled T$38.2 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
